  fractions:`<div class="visual-learning"><div class="visual-label">One half + one quarter</div><div class="fraction-bars"><div class="fraction-bar two-halves"><span>1/2</span><span></span></div><div class="fraction-bar four-quarters"><span>1/4</span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="fraction-bar result-quarters"><span>1/4</span><span>1/4</span><span>1/4</span><span></span></div></div><p>Make the parts the same size: 1/2 = 2/4, so 2/4 + 1/4 = 3/4.</p></div>`,
