  reading:`<div class="visual-learning"><div class="reading-highlight"><b>Main idea</b><p>Exercise supports health.</p><small>Supporting detail: Regular activity can strengthen the body.</small></div><p>The main idea summarises the whole passage; details support it.</p></div>`,
  civics:`<div class="visual-learning"><div class="community-visual"><span>Student</span><span>Teacher</span><span>Library</span><span>Health centre</span></div><p>Community members have different roles and share services and public spaces.</p></div>`
